# variation 1 of b16: the aspect recovers its own error, twice (D-133)
** spec: semantics/aspects.md#what-an-aspect-is
driver b16_test1 is
  process main is
    apply safe();
    apply safe();
    print "driver goes on";
  return;
end b16_test1;
